  'https://www.gov.uk/government/news/prime-minister-agrees-unprecedented-measures-to-tackle-illegal-migration-alongside-france',
  "« For the first time, the UK will help fund a detention centre in France » ; « more than double the number of personnel deployed in northern France to tackle small boats » ; « Additional drones, aircraft and other technologies like surveillance will also be deployed ». Le communiqué ne chiffre pas le montant.",
